  "docHeight": 2810,
  "text": "Zox\nLogo lab\nSign in\nGet started\nNow available on WhatsApp\nYour WhatsApp,\nactually useful now.\n\nSearch the web, summarize PDFs, chat through ideas — all from a message. No downloads. No new apps. Just send a message.\n\nChat with Zox on WhatsApp\nExplore the logo lab\n\nFree to start · No credit card required\n\nSummarise this 40-page PDF for me 📄\n\n10:32 AM\n\nHere are the 5 key takeaways from your document ✨\n\n10:32 AM\n\nWhat's this research paper about?\n\nYesterday\n\nIt covers quantum entanglement in layman's terms. Want a breakdown?\n\nYesterday\n\nWHAT ZOX DOES\n\nOne chat.\nEverything you need done.\nAI Chat\n\nTalk through anything. Get smart, contextual answers back — not search results.\n\nWeb Search\n\nAsk Zox to look something up. It searches, reads, and comes back with the answer.\n\nPDF Summaries\n\nDrop a PDF in the chat. Zox reads the whole thing and sends back the key points.\n\nYouTube Summaries\n\nSend a video link. Get the gist — without sitting through the whole thing.\n\nImage Understanding\n\nShare a photo, diagram, or screenshot — Zox tells you what it sees.\n\nWHY ZOX\n\nNot another chatbot.\nActually different.\n\n01\n\nNo app to download.\n\nYou already have WhatsApp. Zox lives there — no new habit, no onboarding maze, no \"download our app\" moment.\n\n02\n\nPersonality first.\n\nZox isn't a command-line bot wearing a chat interface. It's direct, warm, and genuinely useful — built to feel like a smart friend, not a search engine.\n\n03\n\nPay only for what you use.\n\nSimple credit system. No monthly subscription trap, no surprise bills. Top up when you need to.\n\nPRICING\n\nFree to try.\nPay only for what you use.\n\nZox runs on a simple credit system — buy a pack when you need it, use credits across everything Zox does. No monthly bills. No expiry.\n\nSTARTER\n\n20\n\ncredits\n\n$1\n\nSTANDARD\n\n100\n\ncredits\n\n$5\n\nPOWER\n\n500\n\ncredits\n\n$25\n\nStart for free\nZox\n\nA product of SAMKIEL Studio\n\nGuide\nPrivacy\nTerms\n\n© 2026 SAMKIEL Studio. Zox is a WhatsApp-native product. Not affiliated with Meta Platforms, Inc.",
